    "sections": {
        "description": "The AI Chatbot Theme is designed to create websites with integrated chatbot-focused layouts and modern interface elements. It includes responsive page sections, customizable banners, call-to-action blocks, service highlights, testimonial areas, FAQs, and contact forms to help organize information clearly. The theme provides flexible customization options for colors, typography, headers, menus, and page layouts without requiring extensive coding. It supports widget-ready areas, navigation menus, featured images, and customizable homepage sections for structured content presentation. The responsive design adapts across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices to provide a consistent browsing experience. Clean code and optimized layouts contribute to stable performance and compatibility with commonly used plugins. The theme also includes social media integration, blog layouts, footer customization, and multiple content sections for displaying updates and announcements. Built-in customization settings allow users to adjust the appearance according to branding requirements while maintaining a simple interface. Overall, the AI Chatbot Theme offers practical design features, organized page structures, and flexible customization options suitable for creating chatbot-focused websites with a modern and functional appearance."
    },
